  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Managed Sessions: Professional lifecycle management for TcpSession and UdpSession with automatic reconnection and state handling.\n- Request-Response Pattern: High-level RequestAsync<TResponse> API featuring correlated packet matching and granular timeout management.\n- Session Orchestration: Advanced extensions for handshakes, session resumption, and dynamic cipher rotation on active transport streams.\n- Typed Messaging: Type-safe packet subscription model (On<T>) for clean and efficient application-level message handling.\n- Resource Optimization: Full integration with the zero-allocation PacketRegistry for high-performance, pool-aware data processing.",
